{"id":"n90898-7-6","stage":4,"title":"달라붙다 · 扑","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90898-7-6-1","ko":"너는 형이 돼서 왜 매일 동생이랑 싸우니?","zh":"你是哥哥，怎么还天天和弟弟打架？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"형이","meaning":"哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）","explanation":"형：哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20286","senseId":"1","lemma":"형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형이","audio":"/audio/7eb107b79d357f4a6f75.mp3"}},{"text":"돼서","meaning":"成为，是","explanation":"되다：成为，是；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"8","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼서","audio":"/audio/c6c8c7de6c212f9fe8d1.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"매일","meaning":"每日，天天","explanation":"매일：每日，天天","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58103","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}},{"text":"동생이랑","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동생이랑","audio":"/audio/dab88134e262ec7fd91c.mp3"}},{"text":"싸우니?","meaning":"打架，争斗","explanation":"싸우다：打架，争斗；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸우니","audio":"/audio/5086ab20af4b957fe5a9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"997d7178d3aa00dd","term":"형","zh":"哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3","entryId":"20286","definition":"男子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["형"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，是","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"与某人构成某种关系。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","term":"매일","zh":"每日，天天","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3","entryId":"58103","definition":"一天一天的每一天。","pronunciation":["매ː일"]},{"id":"bc9b651fd875fefc","term":"동생","zh":"弟弟；妹妹","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3","entryId":"70748","definition":"用于指称或称呼相同父母所生的兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年幼的人。","pronunciation":["동생"]},{"id":"e27f0e273d4af17d","term":"싸우다","zh":"打架，争斗","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3","entryId":"29732","definition":"想要获胜而用语言或力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ee6ae469273de7ec5fdd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90898-7-6-2","ko":"동생이 자꾸 덤비면서 달라붙으려고 하잖아요.","zh":"他老是扑过来找我打架嘛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"동생이","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동생이","audio":"/audio/599230a656a3cfb2f54a.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"덤비면서","meaning":"顶撞，扑","explanation":"덤비다：顶撞，扑；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"덤비다","audio":"/audio/d2d7876217585b1c3503.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50281","senseId":"1","lemma":"덤비다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"덤비면서","audio":"/audio/ee42f48beaa293ae5315.mp3"}},{"text":"달라붙으려고","meaning":"扑","explanation":"달라붙다：扑；으려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"달라붙다","audio":"/audio/b75432098b443cbd60a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90898","senseId":"7","lemma":"달라붙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달라붙으려고","audio":"/audio/c585fd9826d3ce519e00.mp3"}},{"text":"하잖아요.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；잖아요：礼貌地提醒对方已知的事实：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하잖아요","audio":"/audio/44f965c4f8e566e5c75d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bc9b651fd875fefc","term":"동생","zh":"弟弟；妹妹","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3","entryId":"70748","definition":"用于指称或称呼相同父母所生的兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年幼的人。","pronunciation":["동생"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"d2d7876217585b1c","term":"덤비다","zh":"顶撞，扑","audio":"/audio/d2d7876217585b1c3503.mp3","entryId":"50281","definition":"顶嘴或对着干。","pronunciation":["덤비다"]},{"id":"b75432098b443cbd","term":"달라붙다","zh":"扑","audio":"/a